DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731, the latest release of DeepSeek V4 Flash =
[https://ollama.com/library/deepseek-v4-flash], is now the default
for deepseek-v4-flash:cloud on Ollama's cloud.
=C2=A0
 * Fast & reliable access: use DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731 with high throughput =
in coding tools such as claude ,hermes, codex, opencode
   and more.

 * Privacy-first: DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731 is hosted in US & Europe, with =
Zero Data Retention (ZDR). Your data is never trained on.

 * More tokens for less: Ollama's Pro subscription [http://ollama.=
com/upgrade] covers long coding sessions with up to 10x more
   usage when compared to equivalent closed models.

=C2=A0
DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731 is currently available on Ollama's Pro and Max plans=
.
=C2=A0

Upgrade Ollama [https://ollama.com/upgrade]

=C2=A0
Interested in Ollama's upcoming Team plan? Let us know
[https://ollama.typeform.com/to/FFV2AVPu#email=3Dpatriogabrielpatdu@gmail.=
com]
=C2=A0


Get started

=C2=A0
To use DeepSeek V4 Flash with Claude Code=
, run:
=C2=A0

ollama launch claude --model deepseek-v4-flash:cloud

=C2=A0
For use with OpenClaw:
=C2=A0

ollama launch openclaw --model =
deepseek-v4-flash:cloud

=C2=A0
For use with Hermes Agent:
=C2=A0

